The law texts in this repository are official texts of the autonomous region of Sicily (Regione Siciliana, Italy), taken from
the Assemblea Regionale Siciliana (ARS), https://www.ars.sicilia.it/statuto-della-regione.

Italian copyright law does not protect them. Legge 22 aprile 1941, n. 633 (protezione del diritto d'autore), art. 5: "Le disposizioni di questa legge non si applicano ai testi degli atti ufficiali dello Stato e delle amministrazioni pubbliche, sia italiane che straniere." (This law does not apply to the texts of the official acts of the State and of public administrations, Italian or foreign.)

The ARS site sets no condition on reusing the texts it publishes; the Statute is an official act outside copyright under art. 5 above. This repository is free and non-commercial and credits the source.

The source is credited as it asks: Fonte: Assemblea Regionale Siciliana, Statuto della Regione Siciliana, https://www.ars.sicilia.it/statuto-della-regione (consulted 2026-10-30).

This repository is not an official publication. The binding text of the Statute is the one published in the Gazzetta Ufficiale; the ARS PDF is a reading copy.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
